<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1946051347"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1637996472"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="iPad"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Chainsmokers"/><amll:meta key="album" value="So Far So Good"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:22.406"><div begin="00:02.922" end="03:10.922"><p begin="00:02.922" end="00:07.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I go through your iPad looking for something that I used to have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我翻看着你的平板电脑</span></p><p begin="00:07.844" end="00:09.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Guess I finally lost my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我终于失去理智</span></p><p begin="00:10.548" end="00:15.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I wish that I could take my number back, go back to the place we met<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多么希望我可以拿回我的号码</span></p><p begin="00:15.605" end="00:17.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Start this up a second time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度重新开始</span></p><p begin="00:18.404" end="00:23.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You're living in a past life, twenty-five, all your friends are verified<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你活在过去的生活里 停留在二十五岁的时候</span></p><p begin="00:23.582" end="00:25.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Acting like they're first in line<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假装他们排在第一的位置</span></p><p begin="00:26.259" end="00:31.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I'm looking at your life through cellophane, hoping things would stay the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我透过屏幕注视着你的生活</span></p><p begin="00:31.462" end="00:33.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I was always by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以前总是陪在你身边</span></p><p begin="00:34.651" end="00:36.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">And isn't it strange<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道这不奇怪吗 我们怎么再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="00:36.801" end="00:38.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">How we're strangers again?</p><p begin="00:42.783" end="00:44.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Isn't it strange<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道这不奇怪吗 我们怎么再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="00:44.723" end="00:46.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">How we're strangers again?</p><p begin="00:48.382" end="00:50.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">And now we're strangers again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="00:56.256" end="00:58.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">And now we're strangers again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="01:05.859" end="01:10.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">You were just a downtown socialite, ship I pass on summer nights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾是繁华都市的社交名媛</span></p><p begin="01:10.789" end="01:12.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Shadow that I can't define<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我捉摸不透的影子</span></p><p begin="01:13.687" end="01:18.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Turned into a gaslight kerosene, love that felt like seventeen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我每况愈下 饱受折磨</span></p><p begin="01:18.644" end="01:20.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Hurt me till I feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我伤心欲绝 直到我觉得我还活着</span></p><p begin="01:21.361" end="01:23.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I wonder who your friends are<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道你的朋友在哪</span></p><p begin="01:23.558" end="01:26.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Where you go, who you know now?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在你去往何处 你认识什么人</span></p><p begin="01:25.785" end="01:27.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">You play the same card<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你还是没有变 对天发誓</span></p><p begin="01:27.460" end="01:29.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Swear to God, do you call him?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否给他打电话</span></p><p begin="01:29.929" end="01:31.713" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Isn't it strange<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道这不奇怪吗 我们怎么再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="01:31.905" end="01:33.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">How we're strangers again?</p><p begin="01:35.605" end="01:37.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">And now we're strangers again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="01:43.458" end="01:45.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">And now we're strangers again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="01:53.064" end="01:58.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">You were just a downtown socialite, ship I pass on summer nights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾是繁华都市的社交名媛</span></p><p begin="01:58.007" end="02:00.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Shadow that I can't define<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我捉摸不透的影子</span></p><p begin="02:00.903" end="02:05.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Turned into a gaslight kerosene, love that felt like seventeen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我每况愈下 饱受折磨</span></p><p begin="02:05.860" end="02:07.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Hurt me till I feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我伤心欲绝 直到我觉得我还活着</span></p><p begin="02:09.307" end="02:13.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">Isn't it strange how we're strangers again?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道这不奇怪吗 我们怎么再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="02:13.267" end="02:17.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Now both of us know we were better as friends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们都知道我们维持朋友的关系会更好</span></p><p begin="02:17.221" end="02:21.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">When it all, yeah, when it all falls apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当一切 当一切都分崩离析</span></p><p begin="02:21.023" end="02:25.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Sometimes you let go just to know where to start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时你选择放手 只是为了知道该从哪里开始</span></p><p begin="02:27.357" end="02:29.403" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Something that I used to have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经拥有的美好</span></p><p begin="02:31.324" end="02:33.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Something that I used to have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经拥有的美好</span></p><p begin="02:35.203" end="02:37.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Something that I used to have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经拥有的美好</span></p><p begin="02:38.602" end="02:40.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">And now we're strangers again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们再次形同陌路</span></p><p begin="02:47.002" end="02:49.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Something that I used to have<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经拥有的美好</span></p><p begin="02:52.340" end="02:56.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Oh-whoa</p><p begin="02:56.000" end="03:00.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">You were just a downtown socialite, ship I pass on summer nights<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾是繁华都市的社交名媛</span></p><p begin="03:00.943" end="03:03.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Shadow that I can't define<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我捉摸不透的影子</span></p><p begin="03:03.869" end="03:08.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Turned into a gaslight kerosene, love that felt like seventeen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我每况愈下 饱受折磨</span></p><p begin="03:08.821" end="03:10.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Hurt me till I feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我伤心欲绝 直到我觉得我还活着</span></p></div></body></tt>